    Events
        Player - Player 1 (Red) Selects a unit
    Conditions
        (Triggering unit) Equal to AtexBlix
        (Distance between (Position of AtexBlix) and (Position of Nazgrek)) Less than or equal to 500.00
        (Remaining time for DialogOverTimer) Equal to 0.00
